Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is this Lt. Col. Roy Mustang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My humble name is Edward Elric...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humble?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be boarding the 9:20 train bound for Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one before that, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now departing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes there is, but it sounds like it's already leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now departing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hop aboard that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm testing their luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:12.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get Lt. Col. Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother,\Nam I scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't say—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, there's someone strange over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marin, that's not nice. Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For him to wear his armor inside the train,\Nhe must really like it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing particularly strange about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see? She likes you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There now, Marin,\Nthat's enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looks like they're tuckered out\Nfrom too much romping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that you've been able to travel \Nlike this without any incident, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said that the situation to the east was unstable, but then here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My, my, the higher-ups sure do take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, where is\NMaj. Hughes right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is communicating with\NLt. Col. Mustang about that other matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That other matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ever since my wife got pregnant, \Nshe's been getting prettier by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I put it?\NShe's like an angel who has\Nwaltzed her way down to earth—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NWe got cut off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What lousy conditions for communications!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one we\Ncan't do anything with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd better make another round to keep myself from worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?\NMy, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:48.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, listen, what am I going to do if the baby is born tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hughes...\NI've heard this story\Nabout fifty times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:06:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to talk about this, \Ntake it up with your wife directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pardon me for breaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, a piece of advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The baby won't be born after just five months!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't hear too well\Nover this phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just got confirmation that there's no one monitoring communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Or so I'd like to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:49.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There have been more passengers\Ngetting on and off than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you factor in the private rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone awfully suspicious!\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're wearing armor this huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there another...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,pipsqueak together with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pip...\N...squeak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was right! He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he really {\i1}is{\i0} little!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling so puny that you can only make him out under a magnifying glass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who said so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, put your hands where I can see 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good day, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hughes! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, inform Bald that \Nwe've taken the wireless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like anyone was using it, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it them, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a call for headquarters from General Hakuro\Naboard the train heading for Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel? Is this Lt. Col. Mustang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Bald, of the Eastern\NLiberation Front "Blue Squad."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have taken control of this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are your demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We suddenly lost contact with one of our allies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone who was supposed to have delivered a statement to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.83,0:09:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring our leader in\NPrison No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,8 to Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll exchange prisoners there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In exchange,\Ndo not kill anyone. If you do—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?\NWe do have a statement here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if the general finds out,\Nhe's going to ask who was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as the situation gets resolved, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already taken sufficient measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this man Mustang thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he does anything funny, then it won't just be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Consider all of the passengers dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that you've\Ndone that, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When their buddies come to get back at us for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't resisted, we probably would've gotten to Central without any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your big brothers\Nwill take care of this somehow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who on earth are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're just ordinary alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?\NI'm Falman. Warrant Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A soldier? You don't look at all like one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a reason why I'm dressed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, up in the first car...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then that's who the criminals are after?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they're dragging all these people into the middle of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, I'll go at them from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You take them from below with this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something funny going on behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! You'd better not shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:13.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was about to tell you that you risked ricochets by shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better not shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Contact from\Nbehind us has been cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you {\i1}did{\i0} have something set up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn yourselves over,\Nand release the other passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things aren't just going to go your way this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones giving orders here, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check all of the cars\Non this train again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And examine the outside of the cars as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard about you\Nfrom Lt. Col. Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the Lt. Colonel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, you'll work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already checked things out below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mess around with the tender! It's the life of this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tender, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't, Bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone outrageous up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:58.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Contact with everywhere else\Nhas been cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said something\Nabout a big suit of armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys in the criminal group, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Threaten everyone else, will you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let the hostages go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Mustang's secret agents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you interfere,\NI'll kill the hostages one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're just itching to do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A water... pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, hostages, please take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the ringleader, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NCome on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I kill the general,\NI'll take care of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fellow Automailer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A brat like you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the military using even children now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that "brat" line!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm not being used by anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid, let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to be in the military long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, I thought\NI wanted to be better armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the military didn't seem to like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were afraid of me becoming any stronger on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shortly after I had this operation, they got rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so... And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:23.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to crush the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've got an arm like that,\Nthen you must've wanted it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to be stronger than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare lump my arm in...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief,\Nthat was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, it looks like you did as you were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Mustang, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The effect on your body probably isn't as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Roy Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My rank is Lt. Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I am the Flame Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's Mustang...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew about all of this when you had us board this train, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not as if I had\Na grasp of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly though, I have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His generalship heard\Nabout your exploits,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:21:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and he said he would\Nspecially allow you\Nto take the State Alchemist Certification Exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Specially?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we came because you told us to take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way a child could take\Nsuch an important military test, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, aren't you glad that I had you take this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether or not you take the test is still up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course we're going to take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take it, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, those people had us\Ndancing right in the palm of their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:58.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, there was no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.34,0:22:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still don't have any power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There he is! Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 6: "State Alchemist\NQualification Exam"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone but me thinks\Nit's impossible for Brother to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, on that day,\Nmiraculous flowers will bloom.
